# Stitch (Compat-Alias)

This is a compatibility alias for the Stitch design-orchestration workflow. For new work, use `frontend-design` directly.

## Stitch Sub-Skills

| Component | Skill |
| --- | --- |
| Orchestration | [stitch-design-orchestrator](workflows/skills/stitch-design-orchestrator/SKILL.md) |
| Design System | [stitch-design-system](workflows/skills/stitch-design-system/SKILL.md) |
| Prompt Enhancement | [stitch-prompt-enhancement](workflows/skills/stitch-prompt-enhancement/SKILL.md) |
| Implementation Handoff | [stitch-implementation-handoff](workflows/skills/stitch-implementation-handoff/SKILL.md) |

## Routing

When `stitch` is requested, the following sub-skills are available:
1. `stitch-design-orchestrator` — orchestrate the full Stitch generation sequence
2. `stitch-design-system` — maintain Stitch-compatible design system context
3. `stitch-prompt-enhancement` — transform rough UI intent into Stitch-ready prompts
4. `stitch-implementation-handoff` — convert Stitch artifacts into repo-native frontend changes

